# CoinGecko API Configuration
# Get your free API key at: https://www.coingecko.com/en/api/documentation
# Free tier: 10-50 calls/minute
# Paid tier: Higher limits with priority support

# IMPORTANT: Copy this file to .env.local and add your actual API key
# The API key is used server-side in /app/api/coins/route.ts
# This ensures secure authentication and CORS bypass
COINGECKO_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# For local development, ensure your server is running on the default port 3000
# The client will automatically use relative URLs (/api/coins) to reach your server
